meta {
  name: Search Content
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/tmdb/search?q=Interstellar&page=1&language={{language}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  q: Interstellar
  page: 1
  language: {{language}}
}

docs {
  # Search Content

  Performs a multi-search (movies, TV series, and people) against The Movie Database (TMDB) API.
  If the query `q` is missing or shorter than 2 characters after trimming, the endpoint returns `{ "results": [] }` immediately without querying TMDB.

  ## Query Parameters
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Default | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `q` | `string` | Yes | — | Search query string (minimum 2 characters). |
  | `page` | `number` | No | `1` | Results page number. |
  | `language` | `string` | No | `en-US` | ISO 639-1 / ISO 3166-1 language tag (e.g., `en-US`, `es-ES`). |

  ## Responses
  - **200 OK**: Paginated TMDB multi-search response (`page`, `results`, `total_pages`, `total_results`), or `{ "results": [] }`.
  - **500 Internal Server Error**: `{ "error": "<message>" }`.
}

